Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我让开！ 妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of my way! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 他们跟来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, they're following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着吧 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch this, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}100欧 赌我能把他们甩掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}100 euros says I can lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.67,0:02:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你赌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你状态不错嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:45.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}操！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把他们甩的够远的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}手放在引擎盖上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands on the hood!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我加倍 赌200 他们会帮我们开路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll double it. 200 says they'll clear the way for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又要输了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going to lose again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}200 赌他们开路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}200 says they clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:02:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成交\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}举起手来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的 你的手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it, your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 让我解释一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我闭上臭嘴 把手放到引擎盖上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut your mouth and put your hands on the hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上给我下车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of the car now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:13.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－轻一点你！ 你快给我下车 快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy! Get out of the car, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不能下车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能！ 他连门都打不开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can't! He can't even open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么鬼话 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你自己看看他什么人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:20.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后备箱里有轮椅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a wheelchair in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉你 他是残疾人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm telling you, he's disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不信你去检查一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go check if you don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轻一点！方 放开 放开我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy! Hey, let go! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:30.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当我干吗呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我在高速上开180码就是为了玩吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I drive 180 on the highway for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗅 嗅 嗅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sniff, sniff, sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赶着去医院呢！！ 噢什么噢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm rushing to the hospital! What are you 'oh'   -ing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我老板 现在他正发病呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's my boss, and he's having a seizure right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间拖的越久 他就越危险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The longer we wait, the more danger he's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他动都不能动 什么都做不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can't move, he can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我在他身边\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why I'm with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们有麻烦了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快过来看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come take a look, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的 我们怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么办？ 你们慢慢想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do we do? You take your time thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不着急\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在想的同时 记得给他15岁的女儿打个电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}While you think, remember to call his 15-year-old daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉她 她老爸因你而死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell her her dad died because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他如果不能在5分钟内得到治疗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because if he doesn't get treatment in five minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就完蛋了！ 他就死了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he's done for! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他废了！ 不过这都没关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's finished! But that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你慢慢想你的办法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just take your time figuring out a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想吧 想吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好想想 他就快死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think hard, he's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧 别浪费时间了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, don't waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们去哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}急诊室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Emergency room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我们来开路 这样更保险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let us clear the way, it's safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给他们开路 快点 动起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear the way for them, hurry, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不在这 都走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're not here, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是恶心 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is really disgusting, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每次看到这都觉得恶心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel sick every time I see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么弄出来的？ 太奇怪了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you get that out? It's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该去考个他妈的驾照了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should get a damn driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道了听到没\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:51.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我们来开路 这样更保险"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's clear the way, it's safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次警察开路可值200欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This time the police clearing the way is worth 200 euros.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦不 我从不赌那么多钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, I never bet that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我们换个地方来庆祝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go somewhere else to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我们来开路 这样更保险"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's clear the way, it's safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}够了 够了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也出力的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I helped too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:07.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开路！ 开路！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear the way! Clear the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:09.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开路！ 开路更保险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear the way! It's safer to clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开路更保险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearing the way is safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:22.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听写：OceanDeep 听校：Prom361(法)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Transcription: OceanDeep Proofreading: Prom361 (French)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}翻译 ceanDeep\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Translation: OceanDeep
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间轴 0ceanDeep\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Timing: OceanDeep
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别鸣谢 舟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Special thanks: Zhou
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 他过来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.75,0:06:52.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们通知医院了 他们马上就派担架过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've notified the hospital; they're sending a stretcher right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走了 你能行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're leaving. Can you manage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行 没问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我们现在做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就看我的吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now just watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《触不可及》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Intouchables
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根据真实故事改编\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Based on a true story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么学习或工作经历吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any education or work experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我有CAFAD证书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I have a CAFAD certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是家庭护理服务证书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a home care assistant certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在交换培训后获得证书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it after a work-study training program.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:33.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是2001年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In 2001.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在Landes 地区的巴里埃学院获得的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At the Barrière Institute in the Landes region.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先 我高考选得是职业方向的学科\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First, for my baccalaureate I chose vocational subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}社会生活服务学\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Social and community service studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有社会家庭经济学的高级技师文凭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have an advanced technician diploma in social and family economics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没.我.就是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't... I... that's just how I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在与其说是工作 不如说是在读书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right now I'm more studying than working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的主要动机是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is your main motivation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:56.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这个人十分注重人文关怀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm someone who really cares about human values.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮助他人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Helping others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得.是这样吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think... that's it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像 就是这样吧？ 好像.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, that's it, right? It seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}额 我很喜欢这一区\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I really like this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:05.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很喜欢.残障人士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really like... people with disabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从小 从小我就.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since I was little, I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认为这有助于残疾人士自主生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it helps disabled people live independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是说 让他们重返社会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is, helping them reintegrate into society.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有运动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恩 应该要运动 要.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they should exercise, they need...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了 恩 重返社会什么的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To, uh, reintegrate into society and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这类人什么都不能做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People like that can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我第一次真正的职业经历.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My first real professional experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是杜邦莫雷蒂夫人.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}was with Mrs. Dupont-Moretti.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位十分年迈的妇人 十分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A very elderly lady, very...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十分年迈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}very elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我参加过 我.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I took part in... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在生活中坚持到底\N{\rEN\blur0.8}seeing things through in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我记得老年医学中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember in geriatrics...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如说吧.还是有美好的时光的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For example... there were still good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们做过烤饼 还做过 恩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We made pancakes, and we also made, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在行政手续方面 我也是专家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm also an expert when it comes to paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是APL\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially APL.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是住房补贴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's housing assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知你们是否\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也享受房补？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}also receive housing assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去查查 玛格丽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check that, Magalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我想应该没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊万拉帕德 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yvonne Lapade?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我等了两小时了 你走开 到我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been waiting two hours. Get out of here, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:09.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轮到我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:16.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想请你们签个文件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like you to sign a document.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气 请坐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么经历吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What experience do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 喜欢的歌手 我有啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, favorite singers? I have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请说吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:35.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如 11库尔邦" 地球 风与火乐团11\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For example, Kool & the Gang, Earth, Wind & Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我品味不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have good taste, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不认识他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请坐吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你连他们都不认识\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you don't even know them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你对音乐可是一无所知\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then you know nothing about music.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着 我可不觉得我是个没有音乐涵养的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I don't think I'm lacking in musical culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使我没听说过你说的什么＂苏苏尔什么的"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if I've never heard of your 'Soussour' or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 是"库尔邦"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Kool & the Gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认识肖邦？ 舒伯特？ 柏辽兹？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know Chopin? Schubert? Berlioz?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道柏辽兹 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know Berlioz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道柏辽兹才让我感到奇怪呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would surprise me if you knew Berlioz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可是专家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里你认识谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who do you know there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道哪憧楼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which building do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么哪幢楼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, which building?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦不 我的老兄.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柏辽兹在成为街区的名字前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before Berlioz became the name of a neighborhood...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可是个有名的作曲家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he was a famous composer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}19世纪的作家和批评家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A 19th-century writer and critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开个玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然知道谁是柏辽兹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I know who Berlioz is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还看出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can also tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:21.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无论是音乐知识 还是幽默感.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}whether it's musical knowledge or a sense of humor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you have none.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我们解释一下你的文件吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Explain your document to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:33.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们只要签个名就可以了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just need to sign it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}证明我来参加应聘了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To prove I came to the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遗憾的是 尽管我才智出群.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unfortunately, even though I'm exceptionally intelligent...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之写上你们的套话就行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, just write your usual spiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结论就是不会聘用我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The conclusion being that you won't hire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得集齐三个签名才能领取失业金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to collect three signatures to get my unemployment benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我明白你的失业金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I understand about your benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的生活就没有别的追求了叫吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there nothing else you want in life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就有一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, there's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个追求够品吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a classy ambition, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我没有不耐烦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I'm not impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我们现在说那些干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But why are we talking about that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们签 还是不签？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you signing or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无法当场给你签名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't sign for you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？ 为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:18.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 这是挺烦人的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, that's pretty annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经浪费了很多时间了 是不是还要再等？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've already wasted a lot of time. Do I have to wait even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确像你说的 这很"烦人'11\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is, as you say, very 'annoying'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那她不能代你签名吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't she sign for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 玛格丽没有这个权利\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. Magalie doesn't have the authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然她还能顺便给我留个电话号码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise she could've left me her phone number too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 明天再来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}9点行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is 9 okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会签好你的文件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll sign your papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:42.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会让你不能领取失业补助金的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't keep you from your unemployment benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我就不送你了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I won't show you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用起身了 我的意思是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't get up—I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:48.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就坐着吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just stay seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明天再来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll come back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 妈妈今天晚回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Mom's coming home late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别开水龙头 别开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't turn on the tap! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关掉 快关掉 不然我没水了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn it off! Turn it off now, or I'll have no water left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:52.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关掉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关了！ 你们都给我出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's off! Now all of you get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去！手 我洗澡呢 你们来凑什么热闹？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out! Hands off! I'm in the shower—what are you all doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫他们出去 都出去 都出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell them to get out! Everybody out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮杜！手 我不能.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pitou! Hands off! I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米娜？米娜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mina? Mina?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:07.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大胖 快出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fatty, get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我 放开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go of me! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去 出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这做什么 出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here? Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们听不懂还是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do they not understand or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮杜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pitou!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮杜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pitou!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你搞什么你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我坐下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:21.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要橙汁还是这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want orange juice or this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪回来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学校\N{\rEN\blur0.8}School.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要去哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去上骑术课\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To my riding lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就会胡说 你.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just making things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是给你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:33.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么久你去哪了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where have you been all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在度假\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}度假？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:39.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为这的人们不讨论你的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think people around here don't talk about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我蠢到最后才知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was the last to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你失踪了6个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You disappeared for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}电话都没一个 什么都没有！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a single phone call, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忽然又这么出现了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then you just show up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还送我一个巧克力蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you bring me a chocolate egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这玩意儿能用来付房租吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can this pay the rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:52.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能用来买东西吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can this buy anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}[塞内加尔语]\N{\rEN\blur0.8}[Senegalese]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当这里是酒店吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think this is a hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说话的时候别看别处！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't look away when I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白痴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你也没法交谈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想和我谈谈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗 德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Driss...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我常为你祈祷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I pray for you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望上帝能原谅你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope God will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不止你一个孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not my only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对于他们 我还给予希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still have hope for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想你还住在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want you living here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收拾你的行李\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pack your bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我离开这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.75,0:18:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我要走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好笑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走了 再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm off. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的 不好笑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, isn't that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:18.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来取我的文件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here to pick up my papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的 我正在等你呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请进\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失业金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unemployment benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能通知菲利普这个年轻人到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you tell Philippe the young man is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甜菜还得等等.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The beets need more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过萝 卜差不多能吃了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the carrots are almost ready to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:50.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:19:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先和你说一下 他昨晚过的很糟糕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just so you know, he had a rough night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来你昨晚也不怎么样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks like you had a rough night too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上7点必须起床\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He has to be up at 7 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}护士也会来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The nurse will come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每天早上 他需要2到3小时的护理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every morning, he needs two to three hours of care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得告诉你一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多应聘者只做了不到一周就放弃了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Many applicants quit within a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里常换人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People come and go here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是喜欢这里的装饰和音乐，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do like the decor and the music,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都很不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但话说在前面 我可不会买下它们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But let's be clear, I'm not buying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我也没准备在这待一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm not planning to stay here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:28.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 听着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的任务是带你逛一圈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My job is to show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也还有许多别的事情要处理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have plenty of other things to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎么说 马上就完事了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, this will be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:36.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们继续 你有个婴儿手机用来交流\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's continue. You have a baby monitor to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就像是个对讲机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能听到他 他能听到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can hear him, and he can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根据合同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}According to the contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拥有自己的私人空间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you have your own private space.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边是卫生间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bathroom is this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这还有个独立的浴室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's also a separate bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 大家等着你呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, everyone's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的文件签好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your papers are signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在小桌子上的信封里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the envelope on the side table.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么想到来应征私人看护的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What made you apply to be a caregiver?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想说 靠救济生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, living on welfare...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不让你感到难堪吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doesn't that embarrass you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的良知不感到有点愧疚吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doesn't your conscience bother you a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还好 你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not really. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得你有能力工作吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think you're capable of working?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有种种束缚 合约 时间.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there are constraints, contracts, schedules...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:21:58.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有责任\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 我搞错了 你还挺有幽默感的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I was wrong. You do have a sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的幽默感多到让我决定试用你一个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have so much humor that I've decided to try you for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你一天时间考虑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll give you a day to think it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.21,0:22:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我敢打赌你坚持不了两个礼拜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet you won't last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:40.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看什么看？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.83,0:22:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有肌肉和骨头都不能漏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every muscle and bone must be covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都得活动活动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They all need to be moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮肤和关节要保持良好状态\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Skin and joints must be kept in good condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做的时候要小心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to be careful when you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谨慎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都听明白了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 醒醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:22:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要睡觉晚上睡去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sleep at night if you want to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没睡觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来帮我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把菲利普抱到椅子上去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put Philippe in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目的地 浴室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Destination: bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个人来试试 做给我看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try it on your own. Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别怕 继续\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be afraid. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没害怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 做到不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没给他系安全带前千万不能松开手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never let go before you've strapped him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也算是我生活的一部分.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is part of my life too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.08,0:23:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是她没和我说啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But she didn't tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.17,0:23:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还在培训阶段呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm still in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想戴副白手套还是怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to wear white gloves or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用力点抓 老天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grab it harder, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我用力了 可不起泡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am grabbing hard, but it won't lather.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.17,0:23:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真奇怪 怎么没泡沫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Strange, why no foam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.46,0:24:00.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们进展如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在给他洗头 可是这洗发水没泡沫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm washing his hair, but this shampoo doesn't lather.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.71,0:24:03.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么可能？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天 这不是洗发水.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, this isn't shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.71,0:24:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把他的脚霜涂在头上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You put his foot cream on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.62,0:24:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯 别让我操心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss, don't make me worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:13.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底识不识字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:15.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}额.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还挺有才的嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're quite talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.12,0:24:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都一个样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通常一瓶全身都能用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Usually one bottle works for the whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这有20种呢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have 20 kinds here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 重新开始吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.71,0:24:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不像在这待两个小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to spend two hours here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是用这个吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用写着"洗发水"的那个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The one that says "shampoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:31.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个人能行吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you manage alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.17,0:24:33.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 是的 你觉得他能行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, yes. You think he can manage?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.29,0:24:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看 我的脚从来没梳理得那么好过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, my feet have never been groomed so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.83,0:24:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧 去吃饭吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, go eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.62,0:24:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里没问题 马塞尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine here, Marcelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.83,0:24:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}裙子在哪里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这袜子是用来固定腿部的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These stockings are to support the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我不穿的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I don't wear them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.04,0:24:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就不能促进血液流动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}blood circulation won't be stimulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我就有可能玩完了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I could be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不会给你穿长袜.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not putting stockings on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来有点小麻烦了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks like we have a little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.25,0:24:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麻烦就是 我不会给你穿这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The problem is, I won't put these on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:24:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.00,0:25:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得要.得要看看.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we'll have to... have to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:02.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马塞尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marcelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.42,0:25:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看马塞尔能否过来.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See if Marcelle can come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮你穿这袜子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help you put these stockings on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.42,0:25:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是女的 应该知道怎么穿这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a woman. She should know how to put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.21,0:25:09.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然是女的 应该.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since she's a woman, she should.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.04,0:25:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道我们为什么要讨论这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know why we're discussing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.33,0:25:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实说 我可不干这事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使是为了你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.67,0:25:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还不如让你玩完\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd rather die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.71,0:25:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实说 在某个时刻 应该.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, at some point, you should...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学会说不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Learn to say no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪怕哪都不去 也要拒绝穿这袜子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if it means not going anywhere, refuse to wear these stockings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.54,0:25:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马塞尔 我们不穿这袜子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marcelle, we're not wearing these stockings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.25,0:25:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧 你还是给我穿了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See? You put them on me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.25,0:25:34.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的小耳环很漂亮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your little earrings are pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这颜色很鲜艳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think the color is really bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.04,0:25:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别开玩笑了 好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop kidding around, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.12,0:25:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的手法熟练的让人觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your technique is so skilled it makes people think...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.42,0:25:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这活你干了一辈子了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been doing this your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:44.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以前从没想过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you never think...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从事美容行业吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about going into the beauty business?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 穿好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There, it's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这手套又是用来做什么的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are these gloves for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.33,0:25:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个么 我们还得等等再用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These? We'll have to wait a while before using them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.67,0:25:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你还没足够的思想准备\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you're not mentally prepared enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.75,0:26:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 他还没有思想准备\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he's not mentally prepared yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.62,0:26:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要什么思想准备 马塞尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What mental preparation, Marcelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.21,0:26:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是干什么用的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.25,0:26:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人会和你解释的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone will explain it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.21,0:26:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马塞尔 我们得谈谈 因为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marcelle, we need to talk, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.79,0:26:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这培训\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This training...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.04,0:26:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is a bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这和思想准备无关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It has nothing to do with mental preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.29,0:26:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正这活我不干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, I'm not doing this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.50,0:26:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不会去掏陌生人的屁股\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going to go poking around in a stranger's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.96,0:26:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使是我认识 我也不干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if I know them, I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.96,0:26:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之 我不掏任何人的屁股\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bottom line, I don't poke around in anyone's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.67,0:26:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是原则问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a matter of principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能晚点讨论这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.25,0:26:25.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如 等我吃完饭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like after I finish eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.33,0:26:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.54,0:26:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为过一会就没有必要谈这事了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because in a while there'll be no need to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:35.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该适可而止了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.21,0:26:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个无意义的争论\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a pointless argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.25,0:26:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不喜欢这种争论\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't like this kind of argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.42,0:26:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那袜子我已经忍了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I put up with the stockings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.62,0:26:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经牺牲自己\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've sacrificed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.83,0:26:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完成任务了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've done my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家一人退一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's each give a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这掏屁股的活就算了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ass thing is where I draw the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.25,0:26:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.25,0:26:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样可不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That wouldn't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.08,0:26:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该适可而止了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.42,0:26:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你胃口好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这 来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.75,0:26:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.75,0:27:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太喜欢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.50,0:27:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不打扰你们吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:09.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在演电影呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you filming a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.67,0:27:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可在吃饭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道哪有啤酒卖吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know where I can buy beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.79,0:27:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你头发应该有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should have some in your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来想买两打啤酒的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to buy two dozen beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你把最后的啤酒买走了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you buy up all the beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.88,0:27:21.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道 也没兴趣知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, and I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.29,0:27:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带着你的鸡毛掸子到别处逛去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take your feather duster and go bother someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.92,0:27:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 我们走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙是我爸新聘的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy is my dad's new hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.00,0:27:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来如此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.67,0:27:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙是有名字的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy has a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.25,0:27:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.83,0:27:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.38,0:28:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.96,0:28:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在按摩呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm giving a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.08,0:28:18.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是不可思议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.96,0:28:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你玩够了没有？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you done playing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.25,0:28:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是 你真的什么都感觉不到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But can you really not feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.62,0:28:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是真的 你在做什么呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't real, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.54,0:28:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做实验\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Experimenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看呀 他什么都感觉不到 完全不在乎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, he can't feel anything, he doesn't care at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.08,0:28:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快停下 你要烫伤他了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop, you're going to burn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}律师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}律师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.83,0:28:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别 别\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.46,0:28:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是私人信件 我晚点再读\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is private mail, I'll read it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.17,0:28:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放在私人档案袋里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put it in the private file?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.08,0:28:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.54,0:29:01.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}垃圾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.75,0:29:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还是有点料的.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's still got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.58,0:29:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能建个"妓女"木档案袋吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we make a 'whores' folder?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.00,0:29:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你胃口好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.50,0:29:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.25,0:29:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当心点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.62,0:29:24.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 哎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.54,0:29:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎 哎 哎！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.83,0:29:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.29,0:29:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.71,0:29:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的 我老忘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck, I always forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.58,0:29:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠 对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.67,0:29:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.75,0:29:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.71,0:29:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.67,0:29:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能过来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.00,0:30:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能过来一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you come here for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.96,0:30:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.00,0:30:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯 听见我说话了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.08,0:30:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在快9点了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's almost 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.17,0:30:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普在等你呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.62,0:30:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么 9点了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? It's 9?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.50,0:30:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没看到时间过得那么快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't notice time flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搓澡需要花点时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A scrub takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.75,0:30:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗窝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doghouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.96,0:30:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我准备一杯咖啡 我马上来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me a coffee, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.38,0:30:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婴儿电话还在你那呢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The baby monitor is still with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.08,0:30:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有巧克力果仁酱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the chocolate hazelnut spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别给我来那些奇怪的果浆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't give me any of that weird fruit spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些水果我连名字都叫不上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fruits I can't even name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.17,0:30:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不想把你抱进这车里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to have to carry you into this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.29,0:30:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使你是我老板\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if you are my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.46,0:31:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能把你像马一样放在后车厢里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't put you in the trunk like a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.21,0:31:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么好东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this nice thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.25,0:31:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 这车不可适合我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, this car isn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.17,0:31:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.25,0:31:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意思就是 很不幸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.33,0:31:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这车不够实用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This car isn't practical enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.21,0:31:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实用？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Practical?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.75,0:31:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 我靠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.50,0:31:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这声音！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.88,0:31:26.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真爽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.58,0:31:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爽吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feels good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:27.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真棒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.67,0:31:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它迫不及待了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's raring to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.50,0:31:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.08,0:31:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又是这邻居 他老在这停车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That neighbor again. He always parks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.33,0:31:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把这当成了他的车位 所以.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He thinks this is his parking spot, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:51.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次应该能改观了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This time he'll get the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.54,0:31:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加一点肥鹅肝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Add a little foie gras.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.71,0:31:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 还好吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.58,0:31:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.04,0:31:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望我没打扰到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope I'm not disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.79,0:31:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派崔克祖维特(法国歌手)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Patrick Zuvit (French singer)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.83,0:31:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来杯咖啡好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about a coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来看看这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.83,0:32:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来 过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.96,0:32:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我好好读读 读呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Read it to me. Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.17,0:32:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请勿停车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.29,0:32:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}响一点 我听不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Louder. I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.17,0:32:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请勿停车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.00,0:32:10.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这方法不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good method.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.83,0:32:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}读完 读完\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Read it all. Read it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.54,0:32:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}私人车位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Private parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.46,0:32:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你给我记住 记住 记住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now remember that. Remember. Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.21,0:32:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后给我滚开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚 快滚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out. Get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.12,0:32:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚吧你 派崔克祖维特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get lost, Patrick Zuvit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.71,0:32:29.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们周二开馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We open on Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.79,0:32:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}周二晚上它就能卖掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll sell by Tuesday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.58,0:32:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.83,0:32:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这都一个小时了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been here for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是时候换个频道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to change the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.88,0:32:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这幅画传达了-一种安谥祥和\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This painting conveys a kind of peace and serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.46,0:32:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至还有一丝暴力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And even a hint of violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也觉得这幅画很让人感动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I find this painting very moving too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些白布上的血迹让你感动？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bloodstains on this white canvas move you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.88,0:32:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这幅画多少钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How much is this painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.75,0:32:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该是3万欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It should be 30,000 euros.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不要我去确认一下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should I go confirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.92,0:32:52.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看是要去确认一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you should go confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:53.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个价格太离谱了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That price is outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.42,0:32:59.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会花3万欧买一滩血吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't pay 30,000 euros for a pool of blood, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.79,0:33:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.00,0:33:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 有可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.58,0:33:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙流了一滩鼻血在画布上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guy dripped a nosebleed on the canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.38,0:33:05.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要求3万欧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he's asking 30,000 euros?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.38,0:33:07.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我 德瑞斯 你认为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me, Driss. Why do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.25,0:33:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们为什么对艺术感兴趣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are people interested in art?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.79,0:33:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道 为了做买卖吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. To do business, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.33,0:33:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.29,0:33:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这是人们来过这世界后所留下的唯一的痕迹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because it's the only trace people leave behind after they've been in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.96,0:33:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是屁话 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's bullshit, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.04,0:33:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我50欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me 50 euros.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.92,0:33:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去建材店 然后完成我来过这世界的痕迹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll go to the hardware store and leave my mark on the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.67,0:33:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你愿意 我还能加点蓝色的作为馈赠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want, I can even throw in some blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:25.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别胡说八道了 给我吃个巧克力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop talking nonsense. Give me a chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.50,0:33:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.12,0:33:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我吃个巧克力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有手臂 就没有巧克力(法国俗语)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No arms, no chocolate. (French proverb)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.62,0:33:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.75,0:33:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说笑呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.96,0:33:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是一个玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.58,0:33:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然 只是个玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.46,0:33:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来是个玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.08,0:33:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这玩笑不错吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.83,0:33:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.50,0:33:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是个不错的玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A really good joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.29,0:33:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个玩笑总所周知\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That joke is well known.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.50,0:33:50.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有手臂 就没有巧克力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No arms, no chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.79,0:33:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过用在你身上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But in your case...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.42,0:33:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.21,0:33:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这玩笑就有点过了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That joke's a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.04,0:33:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好的玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.96,0:33:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没有手臂 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no arms, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.62,0:34:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要告诉辛普森夫人(指离开的女员工)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm telling Mrs. Simpson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.29,0:34:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜这没有观众\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too bad there's no audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.25,0:34:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才搞错价格了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got the price wrong earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.21,0:34:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.17,0:34:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该是41500欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It should be 41,500 euros.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.46,0:34:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我买了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.46,0:34:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.17,0:34:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}近来如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.96,0:34:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你召唤我 所以.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You called for me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.12,0:34:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.50,0:34:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.33,0:34:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么重要的事情急着把我招来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's so important that you had to call me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.92,0:34:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有召唤你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't call for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.46,0:34:45.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该也猜到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.96,0:34:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为什么要见你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would I want to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.67,0:34:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那家伙是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你身边的人都为你担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone around you is worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.33,0:34:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊冯娜告诉我他是个轻率 暴力的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yvonne told me he's reckless and violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.25,0:34:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他揍了一个邻居？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He hit a neighbor?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.08,0:35:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普 这话不该由我来说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe, it's not my place to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.83,0:35:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你应该更警觉些\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.29,0:35:05.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别不管什么人 都让他进你家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't let just anyone into your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.71,0:35:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}何况你现在的状态\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially in your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.67,0:35:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.21,0:35:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你是否明白你面对的是什么人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if you realize who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.50,0:35:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去司法部和西弗谈过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spoke with Siffer at the Ministry of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.71,0:35:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他虽然还谈不上像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not exactly like...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅斯林(法国千面大盗) 但.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mesrine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.79,0:35:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的档案还是挺丰富的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His record is quite extensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.21,0:35:29.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他刚因抢劫珠宝店而坐完6个月的牢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He just served six months for robbing a jewelry store.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.88,0:35:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他能胜任这活 那还说得过去 但\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he were up to the job, that would be one thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.50,0:35:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然他什么都不会.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly, he can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.42,0:35:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要当心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.71,0:35:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}平民窟出来的人可没有同情心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People from the slums have no compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.21,0:35:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.12,0:35:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要的就是这点 没有同情心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's exactly what I want—no compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.83,0:35:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他总把电话递给我 你知道为什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He keeps handing me the phone. Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.29,0:35:50.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他忘了我不能动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because he forgets I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.25,0:35:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确 他对我没有怜悯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly. He has no pity for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.33,0:35:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只要长得高达魁梧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He just needs to be tall and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.46,0:35:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有手有脚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With arms and legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.62,0:35:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能正常思考\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Able to think normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.50,0:35:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}身体健康\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.67,0:36:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么其余的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then the rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.58,0:36:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在 如今 像你说的 以我现在的状态\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, today, as you say, in my condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.12,0:36:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对于他过去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His past...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.29,0:36:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全不在乎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.42,0:36:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然如此 随你吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If that's how it is, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.79,0:36:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就想对我说这些？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that all you wanted to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.54,0:36:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 玛格丽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Magalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.04,0:36:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时间吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我很忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.25,0:36:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会花你很长时间的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.12,0:36:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想给你看个东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.12,0:36:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.00,0:36:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.88,0:36:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又不会吃了你 快来看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going to eat you. Come take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.50,0:36:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 就一分钟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.29,0:36:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.17,0:36:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.08,0:36:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后 我有个浴缸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then... I have a bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.54,0:36:40.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说完了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.54,0:36:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还真够有趣的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.21,0:36:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.46,0:36:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.96,0:36:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以泡个澡？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.17,0:36:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这浴缸很大 容得下两个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This tub is big enough for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以放些浴盐 泡泡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can add some bath salts and soak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.00,0:36:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.67,0:36:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.46,0:37:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊 为什么不呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.33,0:37:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.00,0:37:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始脱衣服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Start undressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.25,0:37:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你原来是这样子的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that's what you're like?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.25,0:37:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闷骚哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A closet flirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.46,0:37:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢 我喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like it, I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:09.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.38,0:37:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.92,0:37:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么啦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.58,0:37:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.46,0:37:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你答应了的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.79,0:37:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不擦肥皂也行 就冲一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can skip the soap, just rinse off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笑什么你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.71,0:37:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}清早 当信件到达的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the morning, when the mail arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.04,0:37:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我总感到一丝紧张\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always feel a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.33,0:37:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像阿波利奈尔所说的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As Apollinaire said:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.00,0:37:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冒号 前引号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colon, open quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.04,0:37:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有你的音信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No news from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.96,0:37:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感到绝望. 11\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel desperate. 11
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.83,0:37:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.21,0:37:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望能收到一封你的来信. 11\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope to receive a letter from you. 11
