Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.75,0:44:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个都会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Both of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.54,0:44:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我20岁的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I was 20,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.88,0:44:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在巴黎政治学院初遇我太太爱丽丝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I met my wife Alice at Sciences Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.92,0:45:01.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是如此高挑迷人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was so tall and stunning,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.21,0:45:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼带笑意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a smile in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.50,0:45:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在你家看过许多照片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw a lot of photos at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.21,0:45:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个金发美人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The beautiful blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.96,0:45:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的确不赖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.00,0:45:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的故事十分精彩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ours was a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.38,0:45:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你至少也能有一次这样的经历\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you get to have that at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠 我真的很爱她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn, I really loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么爱她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.08,0:45:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来她怀孕了1次 2次.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then she got pregnant. Once, twice...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.79,0:45:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后以连续5 次流产告终\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the end, it was five miscarriages in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.67,0:45:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生下达了最后的判决\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The doctors gave their final verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.12,0:45:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她以后都不能再生育了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She could never have children again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.71,0:45:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们决定领养一个小孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We decided to adopt a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.46,0:45:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服务员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.04,0:45:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}劳驾！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.54,0:46:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}劳驾！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.04,0:46:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.50,0:46:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请给我来份苹果塔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An apple tart, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.96,0:46:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}煮熟了的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.00,0:46:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为刚才那个巧克力甜点有些问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because there was a problem with the chocolate dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.00,0:46:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它竟然是生的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.17,0:46:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点黏黏的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bit sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.04,0:46:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}软软的 太奇怪了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Soft. Very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.96,0:46:25.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这熔岩巧克力就是这的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that's how a lava cake is supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.71,0:46:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来如此？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.38,0:46:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.58,0:46:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 不过我是点一份苹果塔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, but I'm ordering an apple tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.79,0:46:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直钟爱竞赛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've always loved competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.00,0:46:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}极限运动 极限速度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Extreme sports, extreme speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.58,0:46:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞得更高 更快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flying higher and faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.00,0:46:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跳伞满足我所有要求\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Skydiving gave me everything I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.92,0:46:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我居高临下 对下面的事物一览无遗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was above it all, with a clear view of everything below.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.08,0:46:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼吸着高处的空气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Breathing the air up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.71,0:46:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从小就被教育要成为一个万人膜拜的强者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was raised to be a strong man everyone admires.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.79,0:46:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我嘴干了 想喝点什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My mouth is dry. I want something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.04,0:46:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是那烟的副作用之一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's one of the side effects of that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.38,0:46:59.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其它的是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.75,0:47:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饥饿感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.42,0:47:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还能让人说个不停.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It also makes you talk nonstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恶劣的天气绝对是跳伞运动的克星\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad weather is a skydiver's worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.38,0:47:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你还是去了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you went anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.25,0:47:16.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 也许是借此来分担爱丽丝的痛苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Maybe to share Alice's pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.21,0:47:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道她承受不了这些\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew she couldn't bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.83,0:47:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果就是 第三 第四节颈椎折断\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I broke my third and fourth cervical vertebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.71,0:47:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只能头部还能动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could only move my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.17,0:47:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当身体痛苦不在时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When the physical pain was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.50,0:47:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}精神痛苦随之而来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the mental pain took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.79,0:47:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真正的残疾并不是坐在轮椅中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My real disability isn't being in a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.54,0:47:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是失去她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's losing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.50,0:47:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生怎么说呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did the doctors say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.79,0:47:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随着科技的进步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With advances in technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们能让我活到70岁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they can keep me alive until 70,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.58,0:47:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通过按摩和药物治疗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with massages and medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.46,0:47:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然价格不菲 不过同时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's expensive, but at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.00,0:47:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是个富有的残疾人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a rich disabled man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.96,0:47:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是遇到这样的事 我就自杀了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If that happened to me, I'd kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.58,0:48:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}残疾人要做到这一点都很难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's hard for a disabled person to even do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.79,0:48:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.62,0:48:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的 真可悲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn, that's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.92,0:48:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天几号了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the date today?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.71,0:48:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道 8号还是9号？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. The 8th or 9th?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.38,0:48:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那今天起就正式开始了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then it officially starts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.50,0:48:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.79,0:48:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你赢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.54,0:48:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的试用期结束了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your trial period is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.50,0:48:19.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我被正式聘用了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I'm officially hired?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.58,0:48:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 你被正式聘用了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, you're officially hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.75,0:48:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我能指望你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I count on you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.67,0:48:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.67,0:48:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.79,0:48:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就先把我的法贝热彩蛋还给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then first, give me back my Fabergé eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.50,0:48:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是爱丽丝的礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were gifts from Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.92,0:48:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每年1个 我有25个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One every year. I have 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.71,0:48:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}象征着我们一起度过的岁月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They symbolize the years we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.54,0:48:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们对我很重要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They mean a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.33,0:48:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 这.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.96,0:48:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你在说什么不是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what you're talking about. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.58,0:48:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你丢的是什么送东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you steal?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.79,0:49:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米娜！ 米娜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mina! Mina!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.17,0:49:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.08,0:49:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点 上车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.12,0:49:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}系好安全带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fasten your seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.88,0:49:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.62,0:49:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学习上没问题吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}School going okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.50,0:49:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么不回我短信？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why didn't you reply to my texts?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.62,0:49:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.38,0:49:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧 什么事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.58,0:49:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是谁来的电话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who called?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.17,0:49:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位警官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.00,0:49:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他找妈妈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was looking for Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.96,0:49:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我装成她的声音\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I pretended to be her voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.12,0:49:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说我们会去接他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Said we'd come get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.46,0:49:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找到我的蛋了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you find my egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.50,0:49:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你找到了 还是没找到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you find it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.54,0:49:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才不管你的石头蛋呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care about your stone egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.62,0:50:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我也没找到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I didn't find it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.50,0:50:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对他们说什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.25,0:50:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都没说 你想我对他们说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. What did you want me to tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.12,0:50:13.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情就是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.04,0:50:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在我身上找到了30g\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They found 30 grams on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.42,0:50:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道警察的套路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know how cops work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.58,0:50:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拘留一下 然后就放了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They hold you for a bit, then let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.92,0:50:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去吃饭吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.29,0:50:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我会跟你走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I'd go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.58,0:50:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快上车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.54,0:50:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我！ 放开我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go of me! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.67,0:50:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁送你回家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's taking you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.21,0:50:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚吧你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.38,0:50:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.92,0:50:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她那宝石般的双眼顾盼生辉"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her jewel-like eyes sparkle as she glances around"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.71,0:50:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这象征意义的奇异天性中"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In this symbolic strange nature"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.08,0:50:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这象征意义的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In this symbolic
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.29,0:50:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奇异\N{\rEN\blur0.8}strange
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.42,0:51:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天性中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}nature
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.21,0:51:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么狗屎诗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of shitty poem is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.83,0:51:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}融合圣洁天使与古斯芬克斯的特质"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Combining the traits of a holy angel and an ancient Sphinx"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.58,0:51:09.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我老搞不清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can never remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.25,0:51:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯芬克斯怎么写 是有个"i"还是"y"？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you spell Sphinx? With an 'i' or a 'y'?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.00,0:51:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.50,0:51:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的诗让我头痛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your poem is giving me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.42,0:51:16.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是"i 单数\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an 'i'—singular.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.75,0:51:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写这些狗屁有什么用？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the point of writing this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.50,0:51:21.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯芬克斯 小雏菊 天使.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sphinx, daisies, angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.96,0:51:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果有男人对你说这个 你不觉得无聊吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If a man said this to you, wouldn't you find it boring?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.33,0:51:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些人的方法比这低级多了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some guys' methods are much cruder than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.67,0:51:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯芬克斯的特质" 然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The traits of the Sphinx"—and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.62,0:51:33.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那个埃莱奥诺长什么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does your Eléonore look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.46,0:51:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.25,0:51:36.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对我而言并不重要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}聪明和柔情才是我看重的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Intelligence and tenderness are what I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.58,0:51:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在关注外表前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before caring about appearances,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.83,0:51:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我所需要的是一种柏拉图式的爱情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what I need is a Platonic love.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.12,0:51:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柏拉图式爱情是不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Platonic love is nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.00,0:51:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可如果她是个恐龙呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but what if she's a dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.00,0:51:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你将和一个恐龙谈恋爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd be dating a dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.79,0:51:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真高雅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.38,0:51:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.58,0:51:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无话可说.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.38,0:51:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算你厉害\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.75,0:51:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 你们这样多久了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, how long have you two been like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.58,0:52:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 这人真讨厌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, this guy is really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.88,0:52:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}6个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.25,0:52:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}6个月？ 一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six months? A—
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.96,0:52:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}6个月 了你们还没见过面？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six months and you still haven't met?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.04,0:52:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可能长得很丑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She might be really ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.54,0:52:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是个胖子 甚至残疾.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or fat, or even disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.79,0:52:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该在诗的结尾写上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should write at the end of the poem,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.33,0:52:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在体重这方面上 你有多重？"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"On the subject of weight, how much do you weigh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.21,0:52:18.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Write that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯 真是谢谢你 你的建议还真中肯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss, thank you so much. Your advice is really insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.75,0:52:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们继续 我说到哪了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's continue. Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.21,0:52:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该是说到斯芬克斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you were at the Sphinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.04,0:52:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃着小雏菊 和天使打成一片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eating daisies and mingling with angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.21,0:52:32.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他一路狂奔 做些奇怪的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then he runs around like crazy doing strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.75,0:52:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.62,0:52:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这象征意义的奇异天性中"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In this symbolic strange nature"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.46,0:52:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给她打电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.96,0:52:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}融合圣洁天使与古斯芬克斯的特质"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Combining the traits of a holy angel and an ancient Sphinx"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.50,0:52:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了 给她打电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said, call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.21,0:52:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}够了 德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's enough, Driss.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.25,0:52:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写信能让我传达更多的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Writing letters lets me convey more.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.96,0:52:52.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.00,0:52:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真是让人受不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's really unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.96,0:52:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行 不过我要去找她的电话号码哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, but I'm going to find her phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.79,0:52:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你的诗让要把我逼疯了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because your poem is driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.62,0:53:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.25,0:53:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她住在敦刻尔克 这可不太妙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She lives in Dunkirk. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.29,0:53:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把信放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the letter down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.71,0:53:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见过敦刻尔克出过法国小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've never seen a Miss France come from Dunkirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.21,0:53:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一般说来 那的女人都很丑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Generally speaking, the women there are ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.50,0:53:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快把信放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the letter down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.21,0:53:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠 她留了电话号码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit, she left her phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.71,0:53:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是手写的 这是个暗示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's handwritten. That's a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.17,0:53:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}暗示你给他打电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A hint for you to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.25,0:53:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把信放下 拜托了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the letter down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.21,0:53:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普 你到底在想什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe, what on earth are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.17,0:53:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她给你留了电话号码 手写的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She left you her phone number, handwritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.62,0:53:21.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道这意味着什么？ 等你电话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what this means? She's waiting for your call!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.29,0:53:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要添你的小耳朵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me whisper in your little ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.46,0:53:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他在做什么？  -就是这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}—What's he doing? —Just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.50,0:53:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定是的 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It must be, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.46,0:53:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你别给她打电话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't call her!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.38,0:53:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她才不管你那些诗歌呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She doesn't care about your poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.71,0:53:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}6个月的诗歌.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six months of poetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.25,0:53:29.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－他彻底疯了 给我打电话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}—He's completely lost it. Call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.58,0:53:31.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－反正我不会听电话 -不然我不理你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}—I won't answer anyway. —Then I won't talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.33,0:53:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我先听听她有没有奇怪的口音\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me hear if she has a weird accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.33,0:53:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敦刻尔克可是北方佬的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dunkirk is Ch'ti country.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:36.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把电话挂了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.46,0:53:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要我的小菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want my little Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.25,0:53:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会听到你的声音的 会的.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll hear your voice. She will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.88,0:53:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.58,0:53:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}声音还行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her voice is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.75,0:53:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.54,0:53:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.71,0:53:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.83,0:53:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.21,0:53:50.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和她谈你们的信件往来.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk to her about your letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.75,0:53:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃莱奥诺？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eléonore?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.00,0:53:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.83,0:53:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.50,0:53:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你打电话 因为我很想听见你的声音\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm calling because I really wanted to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.12,0:54:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要说的是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I mean is...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.75,0:54:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的一句"喂" 就让我心满意足了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your "hello" alone is enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.38,0:54:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请稍等 我去叫她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One moment, I'll get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.67,0:54:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别扯远了直入主题！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't ramble. Get to the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.96,0:54:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.62,0:54:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂 埃莱奥诺？手 我是菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Eléonore? It's Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.33,0:54:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚在给你写信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just writing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.04,0:54:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写着写着.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And while writing...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.75,0:54:19.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忽然我对自己说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suddenly said to myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.04,0:54:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不给她打个电话呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not give her a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.71,0:54:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别忘了问她体重\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't forget to ask her weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.21,0:54:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.12,0:54:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 没什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.79,0:54:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我沉浸在悲痛之中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am immersed in grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.25,0:54:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哭泣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.88,0:54:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我害怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.92,0:54:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主啊 请给我一丝安慰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lord, give me some comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.29,0:54:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 11疯狂的贞女"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, the foolish virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.88,0:54:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是无所不知\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.12,0:54:36.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.33,0:54:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思 对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.38,0:54:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才排在这的 谢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was in line here. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.67,0:54:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃莱奥诺 我很高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eléonore, I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.46,0:54:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的 我很高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.46,0:54:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还真能聊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She can really talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.00,0:54:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是个啰嗦鬼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a chatterbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.54,0:54:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停不下来了 一好了 我得说再见了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She won't stop. Okay, I have to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.42,0:54:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都亲吻 大家都舔舔耳朵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone kisses, everyone nibbles ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.04,0:54:51.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.38,0:54:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.75,0:54:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是 有好消息 也有坏消息\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, there's good news and bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.79,0:54:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好消息是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.04,0:55:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}53 公斤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}53 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.29,0:55:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}53公斤 不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}53 kilos. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.33,0:55:03.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非她身高只有11 m\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless she's only 1.10 meters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.33,0:55:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坏消息是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bad news is...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.21,0:55:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她想要一张照片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She wants a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.08,0:55:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.12,0:55:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢 你真搞笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So? You're hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.83,0:55:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好 先生们 请出示入场券\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening, gentlemen. Tickets, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.83,0:55:14.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.67,0:55:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在那边\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.54,0:55:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.21,0:55:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.88,0:55:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.92,0:55:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你找我的话 我就在那边\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you need me, I'll be over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.71,0:55:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不会走开的 尤其是他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We won't go far. Especially him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.75,0:55:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认为女人们需要的是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think women need?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.00,0:55:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.42,0:55:31.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美丽 魅力 高雅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beauty, charm, elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.29,0:55:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一派胡言！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.17,0:55:34.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们要的是钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They want money.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.62,0:55:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是安全感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.08,0:55:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不信你问他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ask him if you don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.17,0:55:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你 你有她们想要的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you, you have what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.38,0:55:44.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或许我太天真了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe I'm too naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.54,0:55:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我希望 除了我的银行账户外\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I hope that, apart from my bank account...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.50,0:55:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有别的地方能吸引她们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...there are other things that attract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.38,0:55:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她花了6个月来读你那无聊的古诗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She spent six months reading your boring old poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.50,0:55:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她喜欢你！ 她是个另类的女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She likes you! She's a special woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.58,0:55:55.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能肯定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.67,0:55:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很可能她完全不在乎你的轮椅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She probably doesn't care at all about your wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.21,0:55:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说的有理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.50,0:56:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且北方佬喝醉后爱打老婆.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Northerners beat their wives when they're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.04,0:56:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你在一起 她不用担心这一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With you, she won't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.79,0:56:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有趣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.79,0:56:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这很实际吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's practical, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.08,0:56:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道.也许吧.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.92,0:56:14.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照片将是个很好的测试\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The photo will be a good test.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.17,0:56:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果她也给你寄照片了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If she sends you a photo too...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.62,0:56:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就说明她愿意和你发展\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...it means she's willing to go further with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.46,0:56:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后 你可以给他寄一张有轮椅的照片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you can send her a photo with your wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.88,0:56:20.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但照片上又看不太出轮椅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the wheelchair shouldn't be too obvious in the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.83,0:56:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不一定要给寄一张白痴一样的照片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to send her a stupid-looking photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.46,0:56:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}留着口水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drooling
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.17,0:56:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一脸痴呆相！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looking like a total idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.33,0:56:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 好了 我明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.42,0:56:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他能看见吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can he see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.25,0:56:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我闭嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I'll shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.67,0:56:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一棵树\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.46,0:56:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一棵会唱歌的树\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A singing tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.75,0:56:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.54,0:57:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他唱的是德语？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he singing in German?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.54,0:57:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘什么嘘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you shushing me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.17,0:57:08.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是德语吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it German?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.92,0:57:10.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}竟然还是德语.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it really is German.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.96,0:57:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是疯了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.00,0:57:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是受不了！ 这演出有多长？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't take this! How long is the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.33,0:57:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}4个小时！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.38,0:57:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那时很帅嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You looked handsome back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.75,0:57:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪张照片？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.71,0:57:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这张\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.71,0:57:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然还有这张\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.00,0:57:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这张很不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This one's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.75,0:57:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看不出是轮椅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't tell it's a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.12,0:57:40.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过人们心里又会有个小疑问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it'll still raise a little question in people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.88,0:57:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外表也很帅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look handsome too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.46,0:57:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们试试？ 就寄这张？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should we try it? Send this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.92,0:57:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.29,0:57:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给她打过电话了 难道你不喜欢她吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You called her. Don't you like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.08,0:57:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.46,0:57:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是喜欢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.75,0:57:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很爱她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.62,0:57:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不得了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.50,0:57:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 把这张鬼照片放进信封里吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, put this damn photo in the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.08,0:57:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是我想听到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.50,0:57:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.92,0:58:05.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我来支烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.96,0:58:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不知道要敲门吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you know how to knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在画画？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.58,0:58:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.25,0:58:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的 你在作画？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, you paint?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.04,0:58:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还识字 所以你准备.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can read, so you're going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.71,0:58:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 你想干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.25,0:58:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去 快滚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out! Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.17,0:58:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想对我做什么？ 想打我是不是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you going to do to me? Hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.12,0:58:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你们国家都是这样对待妇女的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that how you treat women in your country?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.75,0:58:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你脑子烧坏了还是怎么的？ 快出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you out of your mind? Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.62,0:58:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想出去的时候自己会走 明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll leave when I decide to leave, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.54,0:58:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 是 快出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, yes, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.50,0:58:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看 现在我决定走了 所以我才走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See? Now I've decided to leave, so I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.92,0:58:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.12,0:58:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.21,0:58:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抽出那张照片 换上别的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take out that photo and put in another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.67,0:58:35.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你亲自去寄 谢谢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please mail it yourself, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.96,0:58:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让别人知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't let anyone know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.29,0:58:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.67,0:58:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在把那张照片扔了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now throw that photo away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.42,0:58:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}气死我了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.21,0:58:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出什么问题了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.00,0:58:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问题是你女儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The problem is your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.17,0:58:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才在作画！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was painting!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.75,0:58:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才在作画？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.79,0:58:57.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我想说的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, what I mean is...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.42,0:58:58.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的管教管教她了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to discipline her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.42,0:58:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然的话 我要把她往墙上撞了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise I'm going to smash her against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.42,0:59:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先冷静点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.50,0:59:02.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫我怎么冷静？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you expect me to calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.83,0:59:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的手和脚 这点你没异议吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your hands and feet, you don't dispute that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.21,0:59:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我同意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.21,0:59:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你同意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.04,0:59:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就做你的手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I'll be your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.04,0:59:09.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给她好好来一巴掌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give her a good slap.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.96,0:59:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你除了在她身上碾过去之外\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because other than running her over,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.42,0:59:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么都做不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.38,0:59:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯 你是不是夸张了点？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss, aren't you exaggerating a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.38,0:59:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊冯娜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yvonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.29,0:59:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊冯娜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yvonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.92,0:59:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确 她需要 需要.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}True, she needs... she needs...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.75,0:59:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点管教\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.92,0:59:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}—点？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.00,0:59:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她才16岁 就打扮的花枝招展的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's only 16 and she's all dolled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.50,0:59:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没说她在屋顶和一个鸡毛掸子舌吻呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't even mentioned her French-kissing a feather duster on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.08,0:59:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过这种事我不管 和我也没关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that's not my business, it's none of my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.96,0:59:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是她的问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's her problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.38,0:59:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受不了的是她居高临下傲慢的态度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I can't stand is her condescending attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.04,0:59:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对你说话的态度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The way she talks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.38,0:59:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她对我说话的态度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The way she talks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.38,0:59:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毫无尊重可言！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no respect at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.75,0:59:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她把我们当成什么？ 是狗吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does she take us for? Dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.33,0:59:44.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我个指示 我能马上把她的思想矫正过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the word and I'll straighten her out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.08,0:59:46.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我知道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我来处理 我会和她谈谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me handle it. I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.88,0:59:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就去和她谈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then go talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.29,0:59:53.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽快去和她谈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go talk to her right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.62,0:59:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做点什么！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.96,0:59:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让她思路清晰点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make her see sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.42,0:59:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他画画？ 画什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He paints? What does he paint?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.75,1:00:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.29,1:00:23.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起床了 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to get up, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.29,1:00:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该起床了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.75,1:01:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一点都不尊重那些对我而言很重要的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no respect for the people who matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.25,1:01:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不允许你这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.42,1:01:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的够清楚了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have I made myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.58,1:01:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不够清楚 得再好好解释一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not clear enough. I'll have to explain again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.58,1:01:26.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再看见你的鸡毛掸子出现在我屋顶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to see your feather duster on my roof again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.29,1:01:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}够了 放过我吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.75,1:01:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不够\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.88,1:01:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是不是要我拿轮椅滚你 你才能听话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I have to run you over with my wheelchair to make you behave?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.67,1:01:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样才清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now that's clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.54,1:01:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你画的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You drew this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.83,1:01:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.88,1:01:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很欣赏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.71,1:01:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不敢说我会一定把它放在.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't say I'd definitely put it in...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.83,1:01:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我家里 不过 不过.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my home, but... but...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说这能卖多少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How much do you think this could sell for?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.04,1:01:55.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'd have to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多还是少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lot or a little?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.25,1:02:00.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.92,1:02:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是吧你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.96,1:02:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么啦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.00,1:02:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又没要求舌吻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't ask for tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.12,1:02:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有病你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.50,1:02:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不行了 怎么会这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't take it. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.38,1:02:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得加速了 我受不了了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to go faster. I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.42,1:02:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经是最快了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.38,1:02:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是"我已经最快了11 但是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's 'I'm going as fast as I can,' but...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.46,1:02:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是太慢了 得装个索利斯(引擎)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still too slow. We need to install a Solis engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.42,1:02:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}12 km/h行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about 12 km/h?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.12,1:02:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得可以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think that works.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.67,1:02:21.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}12 kmn/h怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about 12 km/h?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.83,1:02:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最快了吗？ 不能再快了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that the fastest? It can't go any faster?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.62,1:02:24.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经是最快了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's as fast as it goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.46,1:02:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.00,1:02:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.92,1:02:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.29,1:03:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就按摩耳朵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just massage the ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.71,1:03:02.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.08,1:03:21.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.83,1:03:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 伊冯娜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.29,1:03:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他听不到 他离我很远\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can't hear. He's far away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.38,1:03:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他听不到 伊冯娜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can't hear, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.33,1:03:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.00,1:03:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我们8点半准时到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, we'll be there at 8:30 sharp.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.54,1:03:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我们调整时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, we'll adjust the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.88,1:03:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见 伊冯娜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.08,1:03:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么了？ 还在紧张吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong with her? Still nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.79,1:03:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 又是为了你的生日"惊喜"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, again over your birthday 'surprise.'
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.00,1:03:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她把时间延后了半个小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She pushed it back half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.75,1:03:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每年这时候 她都把自己忙的晕头转向\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every year at this time, she runs herself ragged.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.83,1:03:46.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她邀请所有亲戚参加\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's invited all the relatives.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.17,1:03:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}清单列的比乐谱还长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The list is longer than a musical score.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.67,1:03:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们来参加聚会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They come to the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.71,1:03:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主要是来看看.我是否还活着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mainly to see... if I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.54,1:03:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像例行检查一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a routine check.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.50,1:03:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每次都装作很惊喜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every time, I pretend to be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.88,1:04:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家相互迁就\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone puts up with each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.00,1:04:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}话说回来 大家都觉得彼此有些讨厌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still, everyone finds each other a little annoying.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.71,1:04:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.58,1:04:47.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.38,1:04:48.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.62,1:04:51.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请让下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.83,1:04:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能移个位置\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you move over?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.04,1:04:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这个位置本来是我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because this seat was supposed to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.79,1:04:56.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 不能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.04,1:04:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能的 能的 多谢多谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, you can. Yes, you can. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.04,1:05:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐过去 坐过去 快点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move over. Move over. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.17,1:05:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让一个位子出来就够了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just one seat is enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.54,1:05:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真友善\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.79,1:05:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是人靠衣装啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clothes really make the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.00,1:05:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很合身\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It fits well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.88,1:05:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像贝拉克 奥巴马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look like Barack Obama.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.17,1:05:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然 她喜欢我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly, she likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.96,1:05:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝拉克 奥巴马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Barack Obama.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.50,1:05:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉风吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.46,1:05:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像人们对你说你像.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like when people tell you you look like...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.92,1:05:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉法兰(法国前总理)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Raffarin.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.25,1:05:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或乔治 马歇(法国政治家)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or Georges Marchais.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.21,1:05:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在做什么呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.96,1:05:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要错过音乐会了 快下楼去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going to miss the concert. Hurry downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.50,1:06:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.38,1:06:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来大姨妈还是怎么的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you on your period or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.88,1:06:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.96,1:06:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.54,1:06:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾丽莎！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elisa!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.50,1:06:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾丽莎 喔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elisa! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.33,1:06:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我 妈的 你搞什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me go! What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.75,1:06:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做过什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.46,1:06:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪找到这个的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.75,1:06:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在伊冯娜的包里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In Yvonne's bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.29,1:06:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}易蒙停 （止泻药)？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imodium?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.71,1:06:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你吃这个为了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why did you take that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.75,1:06:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了 自杀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.75,1:06:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只会便秘3个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll just be constipated for three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.12,1:06:29.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开 让我安静会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go away. Let me have some peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.46,1:06:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下 你吃了多林潘(退烧药)了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, did you take Doliprane?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.92,1:06:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟糕 你要死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, you're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.21,1:06:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情严重了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.04,1:06:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我该怎么办？ 叫救护车？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What should I do? Call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.79,1:06:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到底什么事情？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What exactly is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.00,1:06:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是巴斯蒂昂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Bastien.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.96,1:06:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么 巴斯蒂昂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Bastien?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.04,1:06:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把我甩了 他根本不在乎我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He dumped me. He doesn't care about me at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.67,1:06:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他甚至把我当成妓女\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He even treats me like a whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.96,1:06:51.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这有点过了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.21,1:06:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之你让我自生自灭 这样就万事大吉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, just leave me alone and everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.88,1:06:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡说八道 快下楼去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nonsense. Get downstairs, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.75,1:06:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别胡说了 来吧 我们下楼去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop talking nonsense. Come on, let's go downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.08,1:06:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个主意 你去见他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got an idea. Go see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.00,1:06:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去和他谈谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go and talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.46,1:07:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk to who?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.42,1:07:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和巴斯蒂昂 我可以付你钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastien. I can pay you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.50,1:07:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？ 你付我钱？ 你脑子坏了还是怎么的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You'll pay me? Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.88,1:07:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当我闲的没事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I've got nothing better to do
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.83,1:07:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会去管小女孩的感情生活？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than meddle in some little girl's love life?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.12,1:07:08.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.25,1:07:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和巴斯蒂昂谈谈？ 你付我钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk to Bastien? You'll pay me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.75,1:07:13.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道自己在和谁说话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know who you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.21,1:07:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 德瑞斯 求你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, Driss. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.71,1:07:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 你付我多少钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, how much are you paying me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.96,1:07:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这头猪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You pig!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.71,1:07:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这画有它的风格\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This painting has a certain style.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.96,1:07:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是有一种风格 但是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It does have a style, but—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.00,1:07:30.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对于一个无名画家来说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For an unknown painter,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.17,1:07:31.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11000欧 我觉得还是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}11,000 euros... I still think...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.38,1:07:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然我是不会买它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not that I'd buy it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.12,1:07:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过一年之年 这画的价格可能翻3倍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But in a year, it could triple in value.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.04,1:07:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我后悔的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then when I regret it,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.83,1:07:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就能对我说 11看吧 我说过的"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you can say, "See? I told you."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.12,1:07:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是在伦敦展出的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's being shown in London?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.96,1:07:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上还会去柏林展出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And soon in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.96,1:07:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有柏林？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Berlin too?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.46,1:07:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.54,1:07:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道了因为.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know anymore, because...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.75,1:07:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这笔钱可是. 11000欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a lot of money... 11,000 euros.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.54,1:08:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啦 透露点信息给我吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, give me a hint.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.17,1:08:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有人了 是不是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's got someone, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.21,1:08:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 福瑞德\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Fred.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.58,1:08:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪个福瑞德？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which Fred?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.54,1:08:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在一起至少两年了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've been together at least two years.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.29,1:08:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关系时好时坏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's on and off.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.71,1:08:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}常常会闹矛盾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They fight a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.38,1:08:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道他们现在在冷战呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know they're not speaking right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.04,1:08:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该是因为我的关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.21,1:08:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她对你说起过我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did she talk about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.50,1:08:24.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.04,1:08:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.96,1:08:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.62,1:08:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠 我就知道 她喜欢我 准是这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn, I knew it. She likes me. It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.50,1:08:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和我开玩笑呢 是不是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're messing with me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.71,1:08:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有 没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.79,1:08:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开玩笑也没关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine if you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.38,1:08:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛格丽总有一天会睡在我的床上的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One day Magalie will be in my bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.50,1:08:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望使人生存\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope keeps you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.25,1:08:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些甜品你还是慢点吃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should slow down on those pastries.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.75,1:08:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你肠胃不好的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If your stomach's bad,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.62,1:08:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然我不是医生 不过.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not a doctor, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.96,1:08:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}易蒙停什么的.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imodium or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.33,1:08:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肠胃不好才会吃这药\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You only take that when your stomach's bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.00,1:09:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诸位 打扰一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.29,1:09:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能帮我个小忙吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you do me a small favor?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.25,1:09:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能给我演奏几段吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you play something for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.50,1:09:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Again?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.08,1:09:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 菲利普 刚才已经够了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Philippe. That was enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.04,1:09:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不够呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.17,1:09:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}维瓦尔第的"四季"？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vivaldi's "Four Seasons"?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.96,1:09:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.62,1:09:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着吧 你会喜欢的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just listen. You'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.17,1:09:17.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.25,1:09:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样 德瑞斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Driss?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.08,1:09:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别和我说你没感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tell me you felt nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.25,1:09:38.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 什么感觉都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.33,1:09:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没想法了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.33,1:09:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我来说 不能跳舞的音乐就不是音乐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For me, if you can't dance to it, it's not music.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.62,1:09:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 我们听听别的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Let's try something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.75,1:09:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这我听过 是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've heard this. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.96,1:09:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是个广告\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a commercial.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.62,1:09:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是咖啡广告？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A coffee commercial?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.25,1:10:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奉天承运 皇帝诏曰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear ye, hear ye, by order of the King...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.58,1:10:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们在子爵堡等我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're waiting for me at the château.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.83,1:10:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把乐师们带来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've brought the musicians.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.50,1:10:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.67,1:10:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我是好骑士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I'm a fine knight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.62,1:10:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 不 这有点暖昧 这是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, that's a bit suggestive. This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.08,1:10:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一群不知廉耻的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bunch of shameless people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.08,1:10:21.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们奔跑着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're running.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.75,1:10:24.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能想象他们在狂奔 确切的说 是在裸奔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can picture them running wild—naked, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.25,1:10:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且还痴笑着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And giggling.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.12,1:10:28.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说够了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.33,1:10:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴赫当时在发情呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bach was in heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.79,1:10:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来他就好这口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guess that's his thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.50,1:10:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是那个时代的贝瑞怀特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was the Barry White of his time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.21,1:10:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这首歌！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know this song!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.75,1:10:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的 我听过 每个人都听过！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really, I've heard it. Everyone has!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.29,1:10:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.96,1:10:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您好 这里是巴黎失业补助中心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, this is the Paris unemployment office.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.62,1:10:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有线路都在通话中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All lines are busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.42,1:10:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等候时间约为2年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Estimated wait: about two years.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.71,1:10:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是猫和老鼠吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't this Tom and Jerry?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.79,1:11:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}猫和老鼠.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tom and Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.83,1:11:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}受不了了 救命啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't take it anymore! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.67,1:11:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些可怜著作.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These poor works.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.83,1:11:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 现在轮到我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.08,1:11:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听过你的古典音乐 该听听我的音乐了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've had your classical music. Time for my music.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.50,1:11:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}地球 风与火乐团 11我和你提起过的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Earth, Wind & Fire. I told you about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.38,1:11:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好听 它酷毙了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It sounds great! It's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.42,1:11:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？西 酷吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about that, Driss? Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.58,1:11:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然 这和古典音乐不同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Obviously, it's different from classical music.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.79,1:11:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.33,1:11:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在开始 我不是我自己了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From now on, I'm not myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.12,1:11:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.08,1:11:34.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.75,1:11:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 这不是德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, this isn't Driss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.08,1:11:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.50,1:12:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来呀 生日舞会就该跳舞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, you gotta dance at a birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.54,1:12:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点 都动起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, everybody move!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.25,1:12:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天是菲利普的生日\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Philippe's birthday today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.71,1:12:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了 伊冯娜 不错 阿尔伯特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it, Yvonne. Nice, Albert.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.25,1:12:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动起来 动起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.25,1:13:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 听着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.54,1:13:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我还没有给你我的礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't given you my gift today.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.33,1:13:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It arrived this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.54,1:13:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我担心她太丑了 会破坏你生日气氛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was worried she'd be too ugly and ruin your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.54,1:13:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以防万一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.67,1:13:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎么说 她回信了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, she wrote back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.00,1:13:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 晚安吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.58,1:13:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是我来拆吧 不然你得花上3个小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll open it. Otherwise it'll take you three hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.21,1:13:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.12,1:13:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是恐龙！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.12,1:13:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.67,1:13:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.08,1:13:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦我靠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.21,1:13:40.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是整个敦刻尔克市最美的女人了叫吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the most beautiful woman in all of Dunkirk. Call her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.67,1:13:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还留了一行字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She even left a note.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.21,1:13:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我下周回去巴黎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going back to Paris next week.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.83,1:13:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你的电话 点点点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waiting for your call... dot dot dot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.17,1:13:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道"点点点"意味着什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know what 'dot dot dot' means?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.00,1:13:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意味着什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.88,1:13:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有戏吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I have a chance?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.67,1:13:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有戏 当然有戏！ 她要吊金龟婿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a chance, of course you do! She's after a rich husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.79,1:13:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}点点点 点点点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dot dot dot, dot dot dot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.92,1:13:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个点 两个点 三个点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One dot, two dots, three dots!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.46,1:13:59.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三个点 我要吊你 结束\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three dots: I want to do you, period.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.00,1:14:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 我要吊你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I want to do you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.83,1:14:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进展的不错嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Things are going well.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.75,1:14:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今晚要睡不着了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't be able to sleep tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.12,1:14:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 不 能睡着的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:09.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把她放在这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll put her here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.88,1:14:12.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会看着你睡觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll watch you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.04,1:14:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}睡吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.25,1:14:15.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.25,1:14:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好梦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweet dreams!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.96,1:14:31.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再试试鸭舌帽？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try the flat cap again?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.71,1:14:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.83,1:14:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.88,1:14:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不 这帽子不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, that hat doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.00,1:14:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像铁路工人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look like a railway worker.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.21,1:14:39.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不够经典\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not classy enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.96,1:14:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才说什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.46,1:14:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好还是不好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.50,1:14:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好 太老套了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not good. Too old-fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.08,1:14:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把鸭舌帽 帽子什么的拿走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get rid of the flat cap and the hats.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.88,1:14:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总有什么不对劲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.96,1:14:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经典还是大牌？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Classic or designer?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.33,1:14:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个部分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's one part...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.04,1:14:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个部分看起来不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One part looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.17,1:14:54.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}渔夫怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about a fisherman's hat?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.12,1:14:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要去敦刻尔克啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're going to Dunkirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.17,1:14:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.08,1:15:01.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一个人去就行了 伊冯娜会陪着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can go alone. Yvonne will come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.58,1:15:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.83,1:15:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.88,1:15:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己能搞定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can handle it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.08,1:15:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.88,1:15:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得有点紧张了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm feeling a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.00,1:15:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看不出来 不用担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't show. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.75,1:15:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.58,1:15:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的答案是20.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My answer is 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.29,1:15:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我过来.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.50,1:15:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大卫 你走你的(指头发像法国歌手大卫)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}David, you go your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.04,1:15:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴斯蒂昂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastien?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.12,1:15:31.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还认得我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.75,1:15:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.62,1:15:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.50,1:15:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对艾丽莎说的坏话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bad things you said to Elisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.83,1:15:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可不太好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Weren't very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.62,1:15:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都没说过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.29,1:15:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你丫闭嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.38,1:15:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在 你得有男子汉的样子 说声对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, be a man and apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.62,1:15:40.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.83,1:15:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿开你的手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.42,1:15:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是对我说 对她说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to me, to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.29,1:15:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 对她说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.12,1:15:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂了吧？ 然后你还得每天早上给她送羊角面包\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it? And every morning you bring her croissants.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.00,1:15:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黄油口味还是普通口味？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Butter or plain?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.12,1:15:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.88,1:15:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黄油口味 还是普通口味？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Butter or plain?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.04,1:15:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管这些\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.46,1:15:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看着办 不过得做像样些\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Figure it out, but do it properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.21,1:15:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}礼貌些 懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be polite, got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.29,1:15:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 走吧你 滚吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, get out. Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.79,1:15:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好梳理你的头 夹个发卡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Comb your hair nicely, put in a hair clip.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.50,1:16:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几点了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.75,1:16:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}16点45\N{\rEN\blur0.8}4:45.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.67,1:16:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能把帽子脱了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you take your hat off?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.83,1:16:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样比较好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.62,1:16:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在几点了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What time is it now?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.79,1:16:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}46 47分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}4:46. 4:47.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.12,1:16:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间过得没那么快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time's not moving that fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.25,1:16:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想来杯威士忌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like a whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.21,1:16:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.83,1:16:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服务员！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.00,1:17:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一杯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.67,1:17:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好吧 你马上就有个约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think so. You have a date soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.79,1:17:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样会不会.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wouldn't that be...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.54,1:17:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双份威士忌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A double whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.54,1:17:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麻烦你 双份威士忌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A double whiskey, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.25,1:17:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:18:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂 德瑞斯 你在做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Driss. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.25,1:18:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不打扰你把？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.12,1:18:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在做运动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm working out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.50,1:18:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.46,1:18:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想不想去透透气？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to get some fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.25,1:18:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都不问？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I don't ask any questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.12,1:18:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 别问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.54,1:18:10.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想逃避是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to get away, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.71,1:18:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.33,1:18:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.17,1:18:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去透透气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.58,1:18:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}透透气？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.62,1:18:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我洗个澡马上过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I'll take a shower and be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.33,1:18:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走吧 拿好帽子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go. Grab your hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.08,1:18:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但马上就6点了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's almost six.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.88,1:18:29.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.96,1:19:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.67,1:19:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给他来点香槟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get him some champagne.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.08,1:19:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能缓解紧张\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll calm his nerves.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.21,1:19:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没紧张\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.00,1:19:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.67,1:19:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就只有我们？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just us?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.21,1:19:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没别的乘客了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No other passengers?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.83,1:19:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是专机？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this a private jet?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.00,1:20:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还是有点担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm still a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.25,1:20:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.21,1:20:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.00,1:20:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个人有点不祥\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a bit of a jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.62,1:20:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事故.轮椅.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Accident. Wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.25,1:20:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你老婆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.67,1:20:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和肯尼迪家族有点象\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A bit like the Kennedys.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.92,1:20:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.92,1:20:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能把那包东西给他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you give him that package?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.79,1:20:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.50,1:20:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.62,1:20:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.54,1:20:46.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this for?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.79,1:20:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你那幅画的报酬\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's payment for your painting.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.33,1:20:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我帮你赚了11000欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I made you 11,000 euros.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.38,1:20:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该继续从事这一行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.58,1:20:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很有天赋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got talent!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.54,1:20:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的确！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.62,1:20:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是比好买卖 而且我作画时就有一种感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a hell of a deal. And when I paint, I get a feeling...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.79,1:20:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就跟着这感觉画 这是一种本能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just follow that feeling. It's instinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.96,1:21:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一种自然而然的感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A natural feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.33,1:21:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再加上音乐 就有了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Add music, and you get...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.00,1:21:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个完美的融合体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A perfect fusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.21,1:21:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它给我作画的启示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It inspires me to paint.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.62,1:21:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}仿佛灯光定格在我身上 真是疯狂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like the spotlight is fixed on me. It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.12,1:21:09.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别高兴过头了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.21,1:21:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11000欧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}11,000 euros.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.12,1:21:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不是个小数目 这啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's no small sum. This—ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.12,1:21:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么啦？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.21,1:21:17.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事 只是机身有个洞而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. There's just a hole in the fuselage.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.25,1:21:18.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次我们死定了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're dead this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.83,1:21:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.71,1:21:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果有问题 你得告诉我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If there's a problem, you have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴认识你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was nice knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.17,1:21:24.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不喜欢这笑话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't like that joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.46,1:21:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的不喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.50,1:21:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你对这种悲剧已经习以为常了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you're used to this kind of tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.33,1:21:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.83,1:21:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没这方面经验！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have no experience with this!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.92,1:22:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是要脑子进水才会去尝试这玩意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only an idiot would try this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.42,1:22:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是有点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.79,1:22:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普 我还是忍不住要对你说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe, I still have to say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.75,1:22:14.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是个神经病！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're completely insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.92,1:22:16.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗 我怎么不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.71,1:22:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 你去给德瑞斯准备吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, go get Driss ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.75,1:22:21.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.12,1:22:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是这样.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like this...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.04,1:22:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和我一点关系都没有 我可不碰这东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's got nothing to do with me. I'm not touching that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.75,1:22:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去那边等你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll wait for you over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.71,1:22:27.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拍点照片什么的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take some pictures or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.92,1:22:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11 给德瑞斯准备"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, get Driss ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.96,1:22:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄 你准备怎么照相？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man, how are you going to take pictures?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.29,1:22:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就笑吧 笑吧 我不干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead, laugh. Laugh. I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.67,1:22:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.38,1:22:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不玩了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.38,1:22:50.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.21,1:22:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个怎么脱？女 好了 能脱了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do I take this off? Woman: All right, you can take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.62,1:22:53.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下 又没人规定一定要玩的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, nobody said we had to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.17,1:23:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的 我不行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.25,1:23:06.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么就出发了 我靠 你干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you taking off? Shit, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.33,1:23:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在那边停下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we stopping over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.50,1:23:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的 我靠 我们在往上升呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit, we're going up!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.04,1:23:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是在干嘛 我操！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on? Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.21,1:23:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.92,1:23:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄 放轻松！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.62,1:23:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我放轻松了 现在该下去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm relaxed. Now let's go down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.46,1:23:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该看的我都看到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen everything I need to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.67,1:23:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.50,1:23:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在旋转呢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm spinning!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.71,1:23:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别怕 德瑞斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be scared, Driss!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.62,1:24:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}提问 哪里能找到残疾人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Question: where can you find disabled people?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.79,1:24:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.62,1:24:27.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.42,1:24:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们被抛下的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where they were left behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.25,1:24:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯 有人在客厅里等你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss, someone's waiting for you in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.00,1:24:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.92,1:24:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你保密功夫做得真好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're really good at keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.58,1:24:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这问题应该我来问你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should be asking you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.75,1:24:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么有这的地址？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you get this address?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.21,1:24:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失业补助中心寄来的信上有这的地址\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The address was on a letter from the unemployment office.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.17,1:24:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.17,1:24:54.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管这个了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.33,1:24:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你搞什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.33,1:24:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从摩托车上摔下来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I fell off a motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.50,1:24:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摩托车摔的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You fell off a motorcycle?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.54,1:24:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.04,1:25:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摩托车摔的？走 起来你 快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fell off a motorcycle? Get up, come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.88,1:25:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摩托车摔的.那边\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fell off a motorcycle. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.79,1:25:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.04,1:25:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你睡这里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sleep here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.75,1:25:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧 发生什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.42,1:25:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.50,1:25:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问你 发生什么事情了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm asking you, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.88,1:25:19.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你没关系 别来烦我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's none of your business. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.54,1:25:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和我没关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of my business?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.50,1:25:21.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这找我 这和我没关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You come looking for me here and it's none of my business?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.75,1:25:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么 我们4个人被人利用了 就这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's nothing. The four of us got used, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.50,1:25:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你别操心了 事情会解决的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, it'll get sorted out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.62,1:25:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么解决？ 你什么都别干！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How? Don't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.00,1:25:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你老妈知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does your mom know?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.38,1:25:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.25,1:25:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心 我能搞定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.00,1:25:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能搞定个屁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like hell you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.33,1:25:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我带来了大麻烦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've brought me a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.50,1:25:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}够了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.00,1:25:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你什么都别动 给我在这等着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now don't do anything. Wait here for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.17,1:25:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听到了没？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.88,1:25:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能躺床上吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I lie on the bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.67,1:25:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和你说了 什么都别动！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you, don't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.83,1:25:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪也别躺！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't lie down anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.79,1:25:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.08,1:25:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放机灵点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be smart!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.75,1:25:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了 我和你说了 他在我这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay. I told you, he's with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.67,1:25:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米娜 别哭了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mina, stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.54,1:25:50.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有受伤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.67,1:25:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是小擦伤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a little scratch.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.12,1:25:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没事！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.50,1:25:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别胡说了 米娜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't talk nonsense, Mina.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.50,1:25:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有谁要杀谁！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody's trying to kill anyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.00,1:25:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是恐吓 只是随口说说的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't a threat, it was just a figure of speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.50,1:25:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们没什么能做的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.25,1:26:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我管不了这事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't deal with this right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.50,1:26:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得工作呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.33,1:26:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 你什么都别说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.42,1:26:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你别告诉她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.04,1:26:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想哭就关在房间里哭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to cry, go cry in your room.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.38,1:26:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哭完什么都不许说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you're done crying, don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.79,1:26:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该睡觉了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should go to sleep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.42,1:26:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还想在待会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to stay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.62,1:26:22.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.71,1:26:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来这坐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come sit here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.67,1:26:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个女人能让你想到什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does this woman make you think of?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.50,1:26:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道 她应该很正\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. She's probably hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.50,1:26:40.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除此之外呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.67,1:26:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 我们上楼去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let's go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.46,1:26:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我楼上还有事情要解决呢.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still have things to take care of upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.21,1:26:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想象她站起来.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I imagine her standing up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.38,1:26:48.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转过身.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turning around.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.25,1:26:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于 我看见了她的脸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally, I see her face.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.04,1:26:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那小子和你很像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That kid looks a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.96,1:26:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿达马是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adama?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.33,1:26:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.79,1:27:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才我观察了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was watching him just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.79,1:27:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果在街上碰到他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I ran into him on the street,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.96,1:27:06.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我立刻会猜到他是你弟弟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd immediately guess he was your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.92,1:27:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.29,1:27:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.54,1:27:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他不是我弟弟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because he's not my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.46,1:27:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.29,1:27:16.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恩 这很复杂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.46,1:27:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他到底是不是你的弟弟？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he your brother or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.79,1:27:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 我明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.08,1:27:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们上楼去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.04,1:27:39.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的父母\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My parents,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.17,1:27:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实不是我的亲生父母\N{\rEN\blur0.8}actually they're not my biological parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.67,1:27:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们是我的叔叔阿姨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're my aunt and uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.29,1:27:48.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我8岁的时候他们来到了塞内加尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They came to Senegal when I was eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.29,1:27:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们生不出小孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They couldn't have kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.42,1:27:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以就去一个有很多小孩的哥哥家中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So they went to a brother who had lots of kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.00,1:27:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并领养了年纪最大的那个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And adopted the oldest one.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.79,1:27:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.62,1:28:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我叫巴加力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, my name is Bakary.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.67,1:28:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的本名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my real name.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.96,1:28:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是小区里这个名字太多了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But there were too many of that name in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.92,1:28:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他们就叫我伊德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So they called me Idriss.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.50,1:28:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道为什么 这名字后来变成了德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know why, but it later became Driss.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.79,1:28:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.38,1:28:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后 就是那么巧合 我妈.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then, by coincidence, my mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.38,1:28:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我阿姨 连着怀孕了2次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My aunt got pregnant twice in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.08,1:28:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来我叔叔死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then my uncle died.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.79,1:28:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她又改嫁几次 有了别的孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She remarried a few times and had other kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.88,1:28:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早说了 这很复杂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.42,1:28:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个小阿达马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That little Adama...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.79,1:28:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是不是需要管教一下了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doesn't he need a little discipline?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.75,1:28:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是来找你的是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He came to see you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.67,1:28:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.12,1:28:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们该到此为止了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we should stop here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.62,1:28:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你也不能一辈子都照顾一个残疾人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you can't take care of a disabled person forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.21,1:29:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为我做了那么多事 值得享受失业金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've done so much for me. You deserve unemployment benefits.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.88,1:29:08.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 上楼吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.71,1:29:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.71,1:29:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴塞利巴加力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bassari Bakary.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.96,1:29:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴加力巴塞利\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bakary Bassari.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.54,1:29:19.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.75,1:29:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像是一首诗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a poem.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.67,1:29:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎就有叠韵了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It almost has assonance.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.83,1:29:25.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道什么是叠韵吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know what assonance is?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.79,1:29:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.54,1:29:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.58,1:29:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好 巴斯蒂昂 谢了 明天见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning, Bastien. Thanks. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.75,1:29:36.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 明天我们吃早中饭 你能不能.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, tomorrow we're having brunch. Can you...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.17,1:29:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的 再见 伊冯娜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, goodbye, Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.42,1:29:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 你没忘了我的泡芙吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, you didn't forget my cream puffs, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.75,1:29:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.92,1:29:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.12,1:29:43.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向艾丽莎问好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say hi to Elisa for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.29,1:29:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.75,1:29:46.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴斯蒂昂 我的朋友 你在干嘛呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastien, my friend, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.62,1:29:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.33,1:29:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.54,1:29:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要走了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.67,1:29:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 不过别担心 我有你的电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but don't worry, I have your number.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.46,1:30:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会给你打电话的 保持联系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll call you. Let's keep in touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.96,1:30:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这对你来说很难接受 你要坚强点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know this is hard for you. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.88,1:30:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可惜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.12,1:30:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了 你知道我会住这间房间吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way, did you know I'm staying in this room?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.04,1:30:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的房间漏水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a leak in my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.96,1:30:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我该留在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe I should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.17,1:30:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以一起在小床上挤挤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can squeeze into the small bed together.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.25,1:30:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这床可能不够大了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This bed might not be big enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.29,1:30:17.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不是一个人住.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't live alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.96,1:30:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是弗德瑞克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Frédérique.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.17,1:30:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.00,1:30:25.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.46,1:30:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.83,1:30:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.88,1:30:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂了 你是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see. You're...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.04,1:30:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实 你是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.29,1:30:38.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.21,1:30:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.58,1:30:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就不和你面颊吻了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I won't kiss you on the cheek.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.42,1:30:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不反对3个人一起.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not against a threesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.50,1:30:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我 我也能接受\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'd be okay with that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.75,1:30:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过现在不行 我得走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not now. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.33,1:30:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我还会回来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.08,1:31:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你愿意的话 今晚 我就能.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want, tonight I could...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.33,1:31:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了 我会回来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.00,1:31:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开玩笑呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.46,1:31:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.75,1:31:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见了 哥们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.46,1:31:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米歇尔撒布缇先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Michel Sabourdy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.75,1:31:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这还开着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's still on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.88,1:31:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}频道2\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Channel 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.25,1:31:26.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛格丽那事 你不生我气吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not mad at me about Magalie, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.96,1:31:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不 做的好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.29,1:31:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做得好 不过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.71,1:31:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就奇怪她怎么能抵抗我的魅力.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wonder how she could resist my charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.62,1:31:33.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是不可能的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.58,1:31:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们面颊吻一下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about a cheek kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.17,1:31:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 好 好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.12,1:31:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊冯娜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yvonne!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.46,1:31:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玩我 她骗我.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's messing with me. She tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.58,1:31:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 再见了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.71,1:31:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊冯娜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yvonne.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.12,1:31:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.21,1:32:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们可能不需要这个了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we might not need this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.96,1:32:09.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧 再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.88,1:32:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脚别放在那\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't put your feet there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.79,1:32:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.83,1:32:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下 你是哪家银行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, what bank are you with?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.00,1:32:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.25,1:32:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能把车停到别的地方？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you park somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.25,1:32:43.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这禁止泊车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because parking is not allowed here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.21,1:32:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那写着呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It says so right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.79,1:32:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上开走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll move it right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.46,1:32:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.17,1:32:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我回头再打给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.79,1:32:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别去麻烦人家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't bother them.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.08,1:32:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们又不开车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't even drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.88,1:32:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是原则问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a matter of principle.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.71,1:32:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.29,1:33:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一会 你先走 在那等我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a moment. You go ahead and wait for me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.42,1:33:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干什么呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.71,1:33:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.00,1:34:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道 我可以取消我的约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I can cancel my date.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.04,1:34:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用 为什么要取消？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No need. Why cancel?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.25,1:35:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安心去吧 伊冯娜 没问题的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, Yvonne. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.83,1:35:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 伊冯娜 我准备好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Yvonne. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.38,1:35:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我就来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.58,1:35:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都准备好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything's ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.58,1:35:12.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要喂他就行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just have to feed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.25,1:35:15.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有任何问题 你给我打电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If there's any problem, call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.62,1:35:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我打电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.42,1:35:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你同意的话 我开始喂了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you don't mind, shall I start feeding him?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.75,1:35:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把白大褂脱了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take off the white coat.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.79,1:35:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这让我觉得的像在疯人院\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It makes me feel like I'm in a madhouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.33,1:35:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.62,1:35:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有烟吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.50,1:35:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不抽烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.96,1:35:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我戒烟了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.12,1:35:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实说 我刚戒没多久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, I quit not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.46,1:35:42.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认为抽烟对你来说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think smoking, for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.62,1:35:44.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并不太好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}isn't very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.42,1:35:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另外 即使你不做运动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides, even if you don't exercise,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.92,1:35:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吸烟对身体也不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}smoking is bad for your health.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.83,1:35:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如肺部 呼吸器官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like your lungs, your respiratory organs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.00,1:35:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼吸.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.71,1:35:54.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不吃了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aren't you eating anymore?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.92,1:36:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.92,1:36:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}[coughs]
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.54,1:37:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做事的时候当心点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful while you work.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.29,1:37:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.42,1:37:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.08,1:37:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 给你.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.83,1:37:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我找一个头部按摩师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told me to find a head massage therapist.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.62,1:37:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是雅克先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Mr. Jacques.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.92,1:37:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.50,1:37:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.79,1:37:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我静静\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.50,1:37:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.58,1:37:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.62,1:37:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 不是你的问题 因为.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, it's not you. Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.75,1:37:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他今早吃错药了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He took the wrong medication this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.88,1:37:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.21,1:37:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃错药.白痴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wrong meds. Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.00,1:37:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.42,1:37:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯巴塞利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss Bassary?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.62,1:37:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.50,1:37:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.50,1:37:49.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个月前才考到驾照？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You only got your license a month ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.29,1:37:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 不过我开车开了很久了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but I've been driving for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.75,1:37:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在私人场所开车 比如一些小路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've driven on private property, like small roads.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.29,1:37:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}公园 停车场.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parks, parking lots.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.42,1:37:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开的很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I drive very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.08,1:38:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看了你的资料\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I read your file.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.83,1:38:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在自我评价一栏你只写了一条 实践性强"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the self-evaluation section, you only wrote one thing: 'practical.'
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.88,1:38:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.71,1:38:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这的确很重要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's certainly important.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.96,1:38:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们公司还看中另一个品质 你没提到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But our company values another quality you didn't mention.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.96,1:38:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.04,1:38:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}花时间读一下我们的口号吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the time to read our motto.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.88,1:38:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这句话几乎就是亚历山大体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That line is practically an Alexandrine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.21,1:38:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.54,1:38:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}花 时 间 读 下 我 们 的 口 号 吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the time to read our motto.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.25,1:38:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}12个音节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twelve syllables.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.92,1:38:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无意的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.96,1:38:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准时到达( 口号)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Arrive on time. (motto)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.04,1:38:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你放了达利的画？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you put up a Dalí painting?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.71,1:38:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在艺术方面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In art...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.12,1:38:41.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许 是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.42,1:38:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢绘画？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like painting?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.58,1:38:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.33,1:38:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢戈雅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like Goya.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.33,1:38:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 她不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, she's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.50,1:38:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从"雄猫熊猫"后 她就没出过什么好歌了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She hasn't had any good songs since 'Tomcat Panda.'
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.00,1:39:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.96,1:39:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.25,1:39:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.71,1:39:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.75,1:39:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我安静一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.42,1:39:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不要喝点水 或者吃点药？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want some water, or some medication?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.92,1:39:21.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.04,1:39:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 你.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.38,1:39:24.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.33,1:39:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.21,1:39:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了 布鲁诺\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, Bruno.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.25,1:39:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气 周末快乐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome. Have a good weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.96,1:39:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}周末快乐 周一见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have a good weekend. See you Monday.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.33,1:39:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到底发生什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.25,1:39:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不太好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not doing well.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.79,1:39:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.71,1:39:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才在花园里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was in the garden just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.29,1:39:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.00,1:40:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？ 近来如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So? How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.71,1:40:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.50,1:40:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让饶勒斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean Jaurès?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.50,1:40:10.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之是地铁站名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, it's a metro station.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.29,1:40:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}维克多雨果？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Victor Hugo?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.92,1:40:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该剃胡子了 你很久没刮了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to shave. You haven't shaved in a while, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.12,1:40:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来的正是时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I came at just the right time.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.96,1:40:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.96,1:41:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.12,1:41:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就看我的吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now watch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.67,1:43:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.38,1:43:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好刮两下 能让我舒服点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A good shave will make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.62,1:43:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看得出你精神的很.乐意效劳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can see you're in good spirits. Happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.50,1:43:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刮地很仔细哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm shaving very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.50,1:43:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}睁开眼睛吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.75,1:43:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太丑了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's hideous!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.25,1:43:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太恐怖了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.12,1:43:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦不 很适合你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.25,1:43:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.00,1:43:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看！ 这里是皮背心 光着手臂.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look! Leather vest, bare arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.79,1:43:48.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}铆钉手镯.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Studded bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.83,1:43:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头上再来顶"村民乐团"的小警帽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a little village-band cop cap on top.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.12,1:43:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 我知道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.96,1:43:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}若泽博韦(法国农业运动家)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}José Bové.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.71,1:43:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好笑了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.04,1:43:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉像是东正教教父\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He looks like an Orthodox priest.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.71,1:44:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.83,1:44:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有病\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.58,1:44:09.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪？ 做什么呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.67,1:44:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想这次会更糟.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think this one will be worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.88,1:44:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 这次很不错 看吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, this one's good. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.83,1:44:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像我的祖父\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.67,1:44:19.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.96,1:44:22.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普 这胡子 我不知道该做什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe, this mustache... I don't know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.92,1:44:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得说 它让我感到很兴奋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to say, it excites me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.12,1:44:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 不玩了 我都刮了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, game's over. I'm shaving it all off.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.58,1:44:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.33,1:44:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.38,1:44:30.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 不 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.42,1:44:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 不 这可不有趣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh no, this isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.33,1:44:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.58,1:44:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不？ (德语)\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nein?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.12,1:44:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想说这吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this what you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.71,1:44:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不要这个样子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't want it like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.79,1:44:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普 陶乐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe, Toro.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.88,1:44:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}生气的菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Angry Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.21,1:44:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是疯子 总有一天你得进疯人院\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're insane. One day you'll end up in an asylum.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.54,1:44:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这胡子有没有激起你想攻占别的国家的欲望？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does this mustache make you want to invade another country?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.00,1:44:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 现在最好用剃须刀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, better use the razor now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.42,1:44:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再刮几下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A few more strokes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.88,1:44:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得的好笑你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think that's funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.25,1:44:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多少有点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.25,1:45:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你让我想到了纳粹残疾人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you make me think of a disabled Nazi.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.21,1:45:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纳粹分子这样打招呼应该很奇怪吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'd be weird if Nazis greeted each other like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.62,1:45:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 够了 你玩够了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, enough. Had your fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.42,1:45:08.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这给剃了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shave this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.46,1:45:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}[装在说德语]\N{\rEN\blur0.8}[pretending to speak German]
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.96,1:45:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生 你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.83,1:45:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 我预约了13点 巴塞利先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, I have a 1 p.m. reservation. Mr. Basile.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.08,1:45:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 巴塞利先生 8号桌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Mr. Basile. Table 8.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.96,1:45:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请跟我来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Follow me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.79,1:45:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边请\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.33,1:45:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.54,1:45:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生 多谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.12,1:45:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.79,1:45:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不留下来吃午餐了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't stay for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.33,1:46:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.17,1:46:02.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会让你独自进餐的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going to leave you to dine alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.33,1:46:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.96,1:46:06.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你待会有个小约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a little date later.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.21,1:46:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What date?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.88,1:46:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.08,1:46:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心 没事的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.96,1:46:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.21,1:46:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过这次你可逃不了了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this time you can't get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.54,1:46:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.21,1:46:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找了很久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I searched for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.92,1:46:24.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总算给我找到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.00,1:46:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}替我我好好吻她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give her a big kiss for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.33,1:46:29.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.04,1:46:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Driss.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.08,1:46:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎么一回事.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.38,1:46:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 菲利普\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.46,1:47:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普现定居摩纳哥 再婚 育有2女\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe now lives in Monaco, remarried, with two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.62,1:47:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿戴尔赛鲁现为企业主管\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adel Sellou is now a company executive.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.29,1:47:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已婚并有3个孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Married with three children.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.00,1:48:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲利普和阿戴尔仍保持紧密联系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Philippe and Adel remain close.
