Dialogue: 12,0:33:33.04,0:33:39.89,NOTE,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(68,110,84,110,0,260)\fad(260,320)\fs32\1c&H00EDEDED}法国俗语，意近‘没付出就别想得到’，
Dialogue: 12,0:33:33.04,0:33:39.89,NOTE,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(68,152,84,152,0,260)\fad(260,320)\fs32\1c&H00EDEDED}此处拿菲利普无臂开玩笑
